{"ID":"20240314092034-7m8ohdx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092034-7m8ohdx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092034-7m8ohdx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162633-xzonosv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162802-2d0gmbr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422162651-84td737\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【十枣汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422162802"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422162633-xzonosv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-xzonosv","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉浮而细滑，伤饮。脉弦数者，有寒饮，冬夏难治。脉沉而弦者，悬饮内痛。病悬饮者，十枣汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-ym3u4fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-ym3u4fs","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-8mpvpic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-8mpvpic","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"芫花（熬）甘遂大戟各等分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-4u3tpiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-4u3tpiv","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，捣筛，以水一升五合，先煮肥大枣十枚，取九合，去滓，内药末，强人服一钱匕，赢人服半钱，平旦温服之；不下者，明日更加半钱。得快下后，糜粥自养。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-tc46diq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-tc46diq","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 419px;","style":"width: 409px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"十枣汤脉型20240328_141831"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/十枣汤脉型20240328_141831-20240328141906-pe6ewjd.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 409px;\" parent-style=\"width: 419px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-99jypo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-99jypo5","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着下来呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脉浮而细滑"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个十枣汤时的脉啊，一摸上去脉很细，脉是这个样子的......（手执教鞭做脉纵向移动）脉的速度很快，所以有的时候，我们经验很多，诸位只要看过几个就会了，我摸病人脉一摸，你就十枣汤已经讲完了。那你也不能说....病人什么都不问你就把十枣汤开完，病人会说你这个医生很差。你没有问我其他，你怎么知道？因为经验多了，可是呢，你还是要假装一下，帮他检查一下，其实心里已经有数了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-2f2vzqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-2f2vzqk","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那从脉可以得到，我们知道这个病人是伤于饮，按照伤寒论的定义，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤症怎么来的？是因为病人被误下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，本来是伤寒，比如我是麻黄汤症，秘便，对不对，那按照伤寒论的原则，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有表症兼有里症的时候，我们先解表，再去攻里，对不对"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？那一种情形是，医生开错了，一看哎呀，你这个便秘有大承气汤，他没有注意到他有表症在这边，还有一种情形是病人自己造成的，去买个便当，便当是坏的，或是吃了死猪肉，诸如此类的，结果，上吐下泻，他本来不想泻的，结果吃坏东西，变成泻下，也等于是误下，结果呢，表的寒邪下陷了，从表从皮肤上，本来是麻黄汤症，这个水下陷以后，陷到肺的下方，跑到肺里面去，就是十枣汤证的来源。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-h210cky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-h210cky","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以脉弦数，全是水啦，就是累积在里边，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"有寒饮，冬夏难治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，冬天，夏天，你用十枣汤开的时候比较难治中，那难治你不能说老师这样子，我们等到春天秋天再开十枣汤，没有那么糊涂嘛，它只是比较难治，并不是说不治啊，你千万不可以给他说，我要等一定要等冬天和夏天再去治，这样不对。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那冬天和夏天不好治的原因，是什么"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？因为我们这个十枣汤开出去的时候，是温阳利水的药，那你冬天的时候是寒啊，好，表面有寒，那你在里面清它，外边寒水会再回来，比较容易回头，比较不容易根治，夏天呢，太热啦，如果温阳利水的下去，外面很热，里面又很热，都不是很适合的时机，好。脉呢比较沉比较弦，这是里面有水吗！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"悬饮内痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是十枣汤证。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-bxvhpr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-bxvhpr8","updated":"20240422162633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那继续介绍，因为这个汤很重要，非常重要，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么我们要知道一些利水的药？比如说我们治疗肺癌的时候，他的状况都很好啊，但突然一下肺里面有积水，你要瞬间把水排掉，那你在那边怀疑犹豫，你怀疑犹豫的时候，这个水就会滋养癌症，一下癌症就扩散了。就得你要瞬间一下把水排掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个十枣汤进去的话，三个小时以后水就全部清光光了，那后面，剂量该怎么用，我们明天来跟诸位介绍。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162633-yy705ms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162633-yy705ms"}},{"ID":"20240422162651-hrts1oi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-hrts1oi","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉浮而细滑，伤饮。脉弦数，有寒饮，冬夏难治。脉沉而弦者，悬饮内痛。病悬饮者，十枣汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-84td737","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-84td737","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-2evs16w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-2evs16w","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"芫花熬、甘遂、大戟各等分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-9q4rgja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-9q4rgja","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，捣筛，以水一升五合，先煮肥大枣十枚。取八合，去滓，纳药末，强人服一钱匕，羸人服半钱匕，平旦温服之；不下者，明日更加半钱匕。得快利后，糜粥自养。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-36lzcoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-36lzcoc","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤就是我们很有名的治疗悬饮的方子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们再稍微给大家回忆一下，十枣汤当初在伤寒论是怎样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-jef8myz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-jef8myz","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是你得到伤寒，太阳伤寒，我们在太阳的时候有三症，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳中风，太阳伤寒，太阳温病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果是遇到太阳中风，是桂枝汤症，你误下的时候不会变成十枣汤症。太阳的温病葛根汤症，你葛根汤误下也不会成为十枣汤证。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只有太阳的伤寒误下变十枣汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以太阳伤寒是因为伤到于寒，所以寒水盛，这个时候寒水一盛，你一攻下的时候。比如我们人体，表寒，表呢被寒束到，这个时候当你的肠胃里面食物很多，功能很好的时候，这个肠胃就是我们的免疫系统，我们的抵抗力。由于我们肠胃里面有抵抗力，所以可以把这个病毒呢抵在皮肤的表面上，病毒在这边，在表面上成为相抗的状态，这个时候是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄汤症，所以病人呢无汗、恶寒，身如鞭痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，好像鞭子打着那种痛，肌肉很痛。那如果你攻下，本来应该是发表，结果你错了你攻下，攻下以后寒就进来了，一进来就停在胃里面，悬饮，就是十枣汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-s5drkct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-s5drkct","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这个地方讲的十枣汤症呢，是一样的情况，这个十枣汤症是常年累月，比如说我们有一个病人咳嗽气喘一直没好，我们医生有一句话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不管中医、西医都有一句话叫做，医生都怕治疗咳嗽，所以咳嗽如果久治没有好，一直治还是没有好，这个饮没有去掉就成为悬饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-an2sa5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-an2sa5w","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们平常人有饮在身上，最简单的诊断方法，老师你怎么知道他有饮呢？很简单嘛，一看他是桂枝汤症，你桂枝汤吃下去他好了才对，结果桂枝汤吃下去没好，他还有饮在身体里面，饮现在分几种，下面我们就介绍这个。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-enq7b6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-enq7b6j","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那遇到悬饮出现的时候，这个肺底下有水，只有一种方子，唯一的处方，没有第二种处方。那你如果说，老师肺里面有积水，我给它抽出来，拿针管去把它抽，抽出来以后，水还是回来，回来你再抽，那就没事三天两头跑医院，抽到哪天你到医院去感染到了 ABveries，感染到了就走掉了。要不要抽？不用抽，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤攻出来的时候，如果清完了他就不会回来了，但是有的时候还要攻第二次、第三次，为什么？因为太久了，太久了以后，你把肺里面的水排掉以后，他水又慢慢慢慢回来，因为习惯了嘛，里面可能有空间，所以你再排再排。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-4adtcwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-4adtcwq","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种汤剂呢，这种峻剂我们都用粉剂，这个控制的量，你看哦，这三味药把它打碎，用水来先煮红枣，红枣是用煮的，然后呢再放药末进去来吞，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药末是生用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的。剂量我们怎么算？十枣汤里面的芫花、甘遂和大戟是比较重，质比较重，所以呢这三个加起来是一钱，三个都是各三分之一钱，放在那个药的那个钵里面，我们打在钵里面看的时候呢，芫花用量就比较多，因为芫花最轻，甘遂、大戟比较重，所以看起来这个芫花会比较多一点，打碎打成粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-zqnrbey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-zqnrbey","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后呢，烹这个汤剂呢一定要有红枣，那红枣呢去煮......你说十枣，老师我就只算 10 个红枣，哪用那么固执对不对？10 个、12 个无所谓嘛，你喜欢吃红枣，15 个也无所谓，没有一定那么固定。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那由于是用红枣来煮，所以这个汤剂呢又名朱雀汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。大家到我诊所临床的时候，就可以看到朱雀堂的堂主就是我，我就是红枣就座在南边，所以我是天火同人的位子，那就是这个药要我来管，那这个一剂下去的时候，因为这个是很强的强碱，吐得很厉害，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以你用红枣下去的时候，红枣汤来吞这个粉，红枣会把胃保护的很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-xp56gvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-xp56gvu","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般来说吃的方法呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"平旦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"早上清晨 6 点钟起来吃，不下者明天再吃，加重一点，得快利以后糜粥自养"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一天吃一次"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果吃了一次以后，吃完以后应该一个小时，两个小时以后开始上吐下泻，那如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"完全没感觉就不要继续吃了，第二天呢你把它加重，再加个半钱进去，代表剂量不够嘛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这样子张仲景要写的意思就是告诉诸位，这个药很强，最好最高明的医师呢，处方是恰到好处，不过也不可以不及，不及的话你手太软，铅笔不够力，开的剂量不够，那水没有完全排掉。那一般来说病人吃完以后呢......这个你们要学会以后诊所我们开处方的时候，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"让诊医师跟病人讲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我就不重复了，不然每次讲，好累。你叫病人呢....这是墙壁，这是洗手台，喝了十枣汤，你跟病人说要侧过来坐，脸在这边，两只腿在这边，面对着这个（洗手台），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你就坐在这边，吐泻是一起来的，一起发生的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以要侧过来坐......所以速度很快。一般来说你开始吐得时候，一般从早晨 8 点钟，有时是半个小时，有时是 1 个小时，有时是 2 个小时，大概要吐到三个小时，三个小时以后症状就去掉了，所以这个药在身上超不过 3个小时，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"偶尔呢，有的时候呢，这个药下去病人没有感觉，就要隔天再来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-60xx5hh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-60xx5hh","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一次呢，我一个......朋友也是老病号，他小到什么感冒，什么都来找我，连手指头破个洞也来找我，他绝不吃西药，这个老外很可爱。结果一天来了，诶我一查，他说我不能躺下去，好难过一直咳嗽，我一查是十枣汤症，他怎么得什么十枣汤症啊？我是他的医生对不对，我怎么会把他搞成十枣汤症呢？可是他看的是十枣汤症啊，先救急嘛，先开十枣汤给他吃，吃完以后，我说给你一剂吃完你会怎么样怎么样吐啊怎么样，第二天来了完全没感觉，我在给他一剂还是一样哦。感觉不对，我就跑到药房去，原来药房正好在交接换人，这个药房新人来了呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他就把芫花、大戟和红枣混在一起变成一钱，这就变很少了，根本没感觉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当场被我臭骂一顿哦，你这种是草菅人命交接人没有交接好，然后我重新配一剂给他，一剂就全部去掉了，他就好了，所以配处方一定要正确，这个红枣羹外行人不懂嘛，外行人就叫红枣嘛，实际上红枣只是保护他的胃，因为上吐下泻以后为预防他的津液伤到，所以会要用红枣汤来吞服这个十枣汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162651-b2jt8u8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162651-b2jt8u8","updated":"20240422162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"悬饮内痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，内痛是痛在哪里？痛在两肋这边，胸的这边，这两边都会有哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162724-b6qtv90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162724-b6qtv90"}},{"ID":"20240422162722-7be9j22","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422162722-7be9j22","updated":"20240422162722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳家其脉弦，为有水，十枣汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162722-urqjf16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162722-urqjf16","updated":"20240422162722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个呢，又回到十枣汤。咳家其脉弦，弦脉就是为水也。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162722-pn7i1ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162722-pn7i1ly","updated":"20240422162722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上的时候，诸位以后有机会实物上看的时候，我常常会摸到十枣汤的脉。有时候一摸，我马上让他们每个人摸，你们每个人摸一遍。以后你们人多，病人就很累，大家都摸（笑）......十个人大家去摸一下。的确是弦脉，那我对弦脉最了解，因为我常常玩琴嘛，一摸就是弦脉，那你不晓得弦脉......没有玩过琴的就不知道弦脉是什么样的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162649-271ep9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162649-271ep9j"}},{"ID":"20240422162621-mmh0shd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422162621-mmh0shd","updated":"20240422162621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夫有支饮家，咳烦，胸中有痛者，不卒死，至一百日是或一岁，宜十枣汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162621-ond3wux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162621-ond3wux","updated":"20240422162621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有支饮家，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"咳烦，胸中痛者，不卒死，至一百日或一岁，宜十枣汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这种支饮家，我们昨天跟诸位介绍过案例，那个小姐，你看她人瘦瘦小小的人很漂亮哦，天哪，气喘二十几年，还是十枣汤证，还没死，你看很好玩那。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162621-418ougc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162621-418ougc","updated":"20240422162621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她只是说那个支饮的很严重，上身下身中间把人变成两个人，他说我上面是一个人下面是一个人。中间这个有东西堵到那边，支饮嘛，悬饮的一种，脉是非常的弦，我就开十枣汤，吃完以后他就说我变成一个人了，中间衔接起来了，所以你说十枣汤好不好用？那每次我用给病人吃的时候一剂就知的时候，病人说你这个药真好啊，为什么吃下去第一碗就很好了？我说我这个 1800 年前就有了嘛，不需要新药，这是我最喜欢用的口语。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162621-02o903o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162621-02o903o","updated":"20240422162621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医最难的是什么?就是很多症状很雷同，我们按照辨证来论治，所以没有看到病人的时候，会有误差，因为病人陈述的，不见得是你想要的。有的时候病人讲的我根本听不懂他在讲什么，我就自己去摸脉把它查出来，常常会有这种现象。所以最好是临证面对面看，尽量不要遥控（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"打电话"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）来看。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162621-98dcxow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162621-98dcxow","updated":"20240422162622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"待会儿我们继续......我们休息一下，下堂课继续讲这一条。休息一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162801-ephhvot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162801-ephhvot"}},{"ID":"20240422162802-vleidag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162802-vleidag","updated":"20240422162802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤和甘遂半夏汤的区别"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422162802-aw9ot50","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240422162802-aw9ot50","updated":"20240422162802"}},{"ID":"20240422162802-7ggjju1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162802-7ggjju1","updated":"20240422162802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果我们严格来区分的时候"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，十枣汤是在肺底下有水，病人不能平躺，一定是坐在那里，甘遂半夏汤呢是在肋间里面有积水，肋膜那地方有积水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，好，那你这样区分，会比较好处理。所以甘遂半夏汤呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人还可以平躺，十枣汤病人不能躺平的，这是帮你区分这两个的最好的方式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162802-ezrvvui","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240422162802-ezrvvui","updated":"20240422162802"}},{"ID":"20240422162802-pysowwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162802-pysowwn","updated":"20240422162802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这里甘遂半夏汤呢，好，这个剂量呢，一般来说，一剂的剂量，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂是一钱，半夏呢，二钱，芍药呢也是二钱，甘草呢，也是二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这几味药呢，用两碗水去煮成一碗，把渣渣去掉，然后再放蜂蜜混在一起，再煮成一碗，这个煮法是不是跟乌头的煮法一样？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个时候一定要用蜂蜜来煮这个甘遂半夏汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。才是真正的甘遂半夏汤，原方是这样的，那病人吃了这个药之后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有甘遂的这个药，病人一定会吐，泻同时来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用这个蜂蜜来煮，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜂蜜可以解甘遂的毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，甘遂的毒...这个甘遂，芜花，大戟这都是很凶的药，但是呢，这种病人呢如果你没有用到甘遂半夏汤的话，这病不会好的。所以这个在肋间有积水的时候，甘遂半夏汤开给病人，诸位这个药开出时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一剂一剂的开"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，给他一付就好了，你不要给他说，老师，他住在很远，给他三付，那吃得太过了，这个不好，这是留饮用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162802-p0rwt94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162802-p0rwt94","updated":"20240422162802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看这个处方，你说用白芍厉不厉害？他这个处方怎么来的，利用白芍在肋骨的地方，我们这个肺的下方，我讲过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺的下方，任何的脏的下方，都是阴，所以你用白芍这个酸收的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，白芍一下去等于是...这个里面好象海绵一样，白芍一下去好像把海绵一挤，水就跑出来了。我有用白芍，后面还有很多地方用了白芍。那这不用桂枝什么的。就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用白芍，用白芍酸收，一挤水就出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，出来以后呢，这个加了半夏，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏利水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂把水整个通通导出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。半夏利水药力很强，如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"害怕甘遂造成肠胃的津液没有了，就放甘草下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个处方就这样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422162802-2d0gmbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422162802-2d0gmbr","updated":"20240422162802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以诸位呢，用处方的时候一定要知道如何用药搭配起来，来调和病人身体里面的阴阳，当你把病人身体里面的阴阳调和到正常的时候，病人的病就好了。所以一定要知道什么药叫做阴，什么药叫做阳，什么药跟什么药配在一起是阳药，什么药跟什么药配在一起是阴药。好，一定要知道这个，这就是技巧。我们经方家是这样讲，温病派没有这样子的，好，温病派反正都是滋阴哪。"}]}]}